From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Richard Spindler <richard@lateralblast.com.au>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 18:20:19 +1100
Subject: [PATCH 18/55] ci: remove the inherited OpenSSH workflows and note the
 fork in the README

Fork-specific, not for upstream. Remove the workflows that only run for
openssh/* repositories (selfhosted.yml, upstream.yml), that need a secret or
a project the fork does not have (github-repo-stats.yml, cifuzz.yml), and the
upstream badge page. Run c-cpp.yml on master only, give both remaining
workflows read-only permissions, and label each pinned action with the
release tag its commit was resolved to. Add a note to the README saying what
the fork is and how its version string is made.

Changelog: sphynx 0.1.3 to 0.1.9

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
